{"id":"5ab184a928aade67","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-kleene-path-expressions.md","title":"DFA 到正则表达式的逐层构造","display":"df-kleene-path-expressions — DFA 到正则表达式的逐层构造","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-kleene-path-expressions","aliases":["73-df-kleene-path-expressions"],"display":"df-kleene-path-expressions — DFA 到正则表达式的逐层构造","depends_on":["[[73-df-dfa-structure]]","[[73-df-regex-syntax]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§3.2.1, Theorem 3.4, print pp. 93–97; PDF pp. 115–119; explicit local syntax construction","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":3},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-kleene-path-expressions"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-kleene-path-expressions</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-kleene-path-expressions — DFA 到正则表达式的逐层构造"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c0782b725f569c3a\" href=\"?note=c0782b725f569c3a\" title=\"73-df-dfa-structure\">73-df-dfa-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"60152252105eae25\" href=\"?note=60152252105eae25\" title=\"73-df-regex-syntax\">73-df-regex-syntax</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§3.2.1, Theorem 3.4, print pp. 93–97; PDF pp. 115–119; explicit local syntax construction"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"3"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,s,F)\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,s,F)\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\(Q=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\Sigma\">\\(\\sigma:\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\Sigma\\)</span> 为固定枚举。正则项构造子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf0,\\mathbf1,\\mathbf a,+,\\cdot,\\star\">\\(\\mathbf0,\\mathbf1,\\mathbf a,+,\\cdot,\\star\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"60152252105eae25\" href=\"?note=60152252105eae25\" title=\"73-df-regex-syntax\">73-df-regex-syntax</a> 的同一实例。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in(\\mathsf{RegExp}_{\\Sigma})^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(U\\in(\\mathsf{RegExp}_{\\Sigma})^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\in\\mathsf{RegExp}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(E\\in\\mathsf{RegExp}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j\\in Q\">\\(i,j\\in Q\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\">\\(k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}\">\\(\\ell\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SumRE}(\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq\\mathbf0,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{SumRE}(U\\langle E\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{SumRE}(U)+E.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SumRE}(\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq\\mathbf0,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{SumRE}(U\\langle E\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{SumRE}(U)+E.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"B_{ij\\ell}\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\mathbf{\\sigma(\\ell)},&amp;\\delta(i,\\sigma(\\ell))=j,\\\\\\mathbf0,&amp;\\delta(i,\\sigma(\\ell))\\ne j,\\end{cases}\\qquad\nI_{ij}\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\mathbf1,&amp;i=j,\\\\\\mathbf0,&amp;i\\ne j.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[B_{ij\\ell}\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\mathbf{\\sigma(\\ell)},&amp;\\delta(i,\\sigma(\\ell))=j,\\\\\\mathbf0,&amp;\\delta(i,\\sigma(\\ell))\\ne j,\\end{cases}\\qquad\nI_{ij}\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\mathbf1,&amp;i=j,\\\\\\mathbf0,&amp;i\\ne j.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R^0_{ij}\\coloneqq I_{ij}+\\operatorname{SumRE}(\\langle B_{ij\\ell}:0\\le\\ell&lt;m\\rangle),\\qquad\nR^{k+1}_{ij}\\coloneqq R^k_{ij}+(R^k_{i,k+1}\\cdot(R^k_{k+1,k+1})^\\star)\\cdot R^k_{k+1,j}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R^0_{ij}\\coloneqq I_{ij}+\\operatorname{SumRE}(\\langle B_{ij\\ell}:0\\le\\ell&lt;m\\rangle),\\qquad\nR^{k+1}_{ij}\\coloneqq R^k_{ij}+(R^k_{i,k+1}\\cdot(R^k_{k+1,k+1})^\\star)\\cdot R^k_{k+1,j}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E_M\\coloneqq\\operatorname{SumRE}(\\langle E_j:1\\le j\\le n\\rangle),\\qquad\nE_j\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}R^n_{sj},&amp;j\\in F,\\\\\\mathbf0,&amp;j\\notin F.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E_M\\coloneqq\\operatorname{SumRE}(\\langle E_j:1\\le j\\le n\\rangle),\\qquad\nE_j\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}R^n_{sj},&amp;j\\in F,\\\\\\mathbf0,&amp;j\\notin F.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>递归严格增加已许可的中间状态数，所有右部只用上一层项。字母与终态枚举使输出成为一个确定的语法树；不同枚举可给不同树，但后续正确性保证其语言相同。空路径只在 i=j 的基例加入。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-dfa-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c0782b725f569c3a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dfa-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-regex-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"60152252105eae25","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-regex-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-regex-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"60152252105eae25","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,s,F)\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}$，$Q=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$，$n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$；$\\sigma:\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\Sigma$ 为固定枚举。正则项构造子 $\\mathbf0,\\mathbf1,\\mathbf a,+,\\cdot,\\star$ 取 [[73-df-regex-syntax]] 的同一实例。$U\\in(\\mathsf{RegExp}_{\\Sigma})^{<\\omega}$，$E\\in\\mathsf{RegExp}_{\\Sigma}$，$i,j\\in Q$，$k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}$，$\\ell\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,s,F)\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"Q=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma:\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf0,\\mathbf1,\\mathbf a,+,\\cdot,\\star","display":false},{"tex":"U\\in(\\mathsf{RegExp}_{\\Sigma})^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"E\\in\\mathsf{RegExp}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"i,j\\in Q","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SumRE}(\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq\\mathbf0,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{SumRE}(U\\langle E\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{SumRE}(U)+E.","display":true},{"tex":"B_{ij\\ell}\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\mathbf{\\sigma(\\ell)},&\\delta(i,\\sigma(\\ell))=j,\\\\\\mathbf0,&\\delta(i,\\sigma(\\ell))\\ne j,\\end{cases}\\qquad\nI_{ij}\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\mathbf1,&i=j,\\\\\\mathbf0,&i\\ne j.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"R^0_{ij}\\coloneqq I_{ij}+\\operatorname{SumRE}(\\langle B_{ij\\ell}:0\\le\\ell<m\\rangle),\\qquad\nR^{k+1}_{ij}\\coloneqq R^k_{ij}+(R^k_{i,k+1}\\cdot(R^k_{k+1,k+1})^\\star)\\cdot R^k_{k+1,j}.","display":true},{"tex":"E_M\\coloneqq\\operatorname{SumRE}(\\langle E_j:1\\le j\\le n\\rangle),\\qquad\nE_j\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}R^n_{sj},&j\\in F,\\\\\\mathbf0,&j\\notin F.\\end{cases}","display":true}],"bytes":2205,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-40","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-kleene-path-expressions|DFA 到正则表达式的逐层构造]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"6852172e9b645edd","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"沿用 [[73-df-kleene-path-expressions]] 的 $M,Q,n,R^k_{ij},E_M$；$k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}$，$i,j\\in Q$。$q$ 是有限状态序列，$w$ 是有限输入词。"}],"outgoing":["c0782b725f569c3a","60152252105eae25"]}